  "bodyText": "Home\nVisit Us\nExhibitions\nEvents\nOnline Talks\nOxfordshire’s Military Heritage in 50 Objects\nCollections\nBlog\nResearch\nLearning\nShop\nCart\nMy Account\nAbout\nBecome a Friend\nSupport Us\nRoom Hire\n\n01993 810 210\n\nfrontofhouse@sofo.org.uk\n\n  \nHome\nEvents\nExhibitions\nCollections\nFriends’ Membership\nVisit\nShop\nBasket\nMy Account\nOxfordshire’s Military Heritage in 50 Objects\nResearch\nLearning\nOnline Talks\nBlog\nSupport Us\nRoom Hire\nImage Services\nAbout\nBooks\nGifts\nMeet Me at the Soldiers Museum | 2pm – 4pm | Thursday 9 July 2026\n£0.00\n\n30 available\nMeet Me at the Soldiers Museum | 2pm - 4pm | Thursday 9 July 2026 quantity\nAdd to Cart\n\nMeet Me at the Soldiers Museum is our regular drop-in for older adults, join us and enjoy a cup of tea, a chat, and reminisce as you browse the museum galleries.\n\nWe particularly welcome groups from care and retirement homes. If you would like to attend one of these sessions with a group of residents, please get in touch.\n\nFree entry, refreshments provided.\n\nRunning 2pm - 4pm, every Thursday during school term times (No sessions during the Easter and Summer holidays).\n\nThese events have been kindly supported by University of Oxford Gardens, Libraries & Museums.\n\nDate: 09-July-2026\nTime: 14:00\n\nLocation: Soldiers of Oxfordshire Museum (The Briefing Room)\nType: physical\n\nRelated products\nPOSTPONED: Kinder | Show Time: 7pm | Date: 16 June 2026\n£15.00 Read more\nSpy Princess: The Life Noor Inayat Khan with Shrabani Basu (Recorded Live at Ditchley Park)\n£9.00 Add to cart\nThe Rise & Fall of the British Army 1975 – 2025 | Talk | 2pm, 13 June 2026\n£12.00 Add to cart\nVeterans Coffee & Chat | 25 June 2026\n£0.00 Add to cart\n\nSoldiers of Oxfordshire Museum\nPark Street.\nWoodstock\nOxfordshire OX20 1SN\n\nPhone and Email:\nGeneral Enquiries & Event Tickets: 01993 810 211\nfrontofhouse@sofo.org.uk\n\nPrivacy Policy\nTerms and conditions",
